{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5BNZ0C6K8W0WN9S9B1B1A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミュージックビデオ\n沢山の方に観ていただけて本当に嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂としては６枚目のシングルとなります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、様々な現場で\nグループが好きです。と\n声をかけていただくことが増えて嬉しい限り"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5BPZ7ZGR5CNFVQAK2T1ZQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４月からスタートした３rd TOURも\n怪我がなく無事に千秋楽、大阪城まで\n皆さんと走り切ることが出来ました🏃‍♀️✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場へ来てくださり\n配信を見てくださり\n仲間も増え新体制となった櫻坂ツアーを\n櫻色に彩って下さり感謝しかないです。\n本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5BR39HQTN3PGPNX4DSX4F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神奈川公演にて\n影アナが一緒だった村井優ちゃんは\n私が考案したつまらない神奈川名セリフに\n一生懸命全力ノリノリでのってくれたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「まもなくはじまる\nかなー？(土生)がわー！(優ちゃん)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"溢れ出る優しさ\n誰もを引き込む瞳、パワーで\n沢山の人をこれからも魅力して欲しい🔥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にこの期間は、３期ちゃんと\nグッと距離が縮まった気がして嬉しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5BS2CW9FB8KSC53CXHPGK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5BT1Z484309G546DT37HG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5BV27ECKQWT5SEQGB11JP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5BW6KXW6RTZZ2P1B05HBR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キラ子とは\n頭に手をかけられるくらい距離縮まりました\nここだけじゃない話。\nちゃっかり水族館デートにも先日✌🏻♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5BX4VMNC829JRXNDMRZ10","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5BY436B76E8VR7YXR3DWV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5BZ4AQR2VQ1MRMM9YXM8A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなにより\n沢山のファンの皆さんと目が合って\nはやく話したいなと思ってしまったよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"６thミーグリ応募して下さった皆さん\nありがとうございました。\n当日お話できるの楽しみにしてます\nそのときに沢山感想聞かせてください🙂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5C0401198J7J959JXE0PJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5C1509VHX3G22N8X17ZC6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間はかかりましたが\nやっと私自身も\nまた一つレベルアップした気がしています。\nそれは日々皆さんが応援してくださるおかげ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今シングルも楽しみにしててね ☺︎"}],"source":"archive"}